        "zh-CN": "面向多源资料研究、来源对比、知识库条目与术语表沉淀的行业方案。岗位只基于你提供或授权的资料形成可追溯草案：每条结论标来源与检索日期，区分事实与推断；写入知识库、对外发送与发布均需本人授权。",
        "en": "A solution for multi-source research, source comparison, knowledge base articles and glossary building. The role works only from materials you provide or authorize and produces traceable drafts: every conclusion carries its source and retrieval date, and facts are separated from inferences. Writing to a knowledge base, sending externally and publishing all require your authorization."
